<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Navneet Kumar — AI • Data Science • Technology • Innovation</title>
<meta name="description" content="Navneet Kumar builds AI and data science systems, explains complex technology, and develops long-term innovation concepts including VAIBHAVI 2047.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
  :root{
    --void:#060a16;
    --panel:#0c1226;
    --panel-2:#111a35;
    --line:rgba(148,168,224,0.14);
    --electric:#3d6bff;
    --cyan:#22d3ee;
    --violet:#8b5cf6;
    --text:#dbe4ff;
    --text-dim:#8b96b8;
    --text-dimmer:#5c6690;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box; margin:0; padding:0;}
  html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}
  body{
    background:var(--void);
    color:var(--text);
    font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;
    line-height:1.6;
    overflow-x:hidden;
  }
  ::selection{background:var(--electric); color:#fff;}
  h1,h2,h3,h4,.display{font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif;}
  .mono{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;}
  a{color:inherit; text-decoration:none;}
  .wrap{max-width:1180px; margin:0 auto; padding:0 32px;}
  @media(max-width:640px){.wrap{padding:0 20px;}}

  /* background texture */
  .bg-grid{
    position:fixed; inset:0; z-index:0; pointer-events:none;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(rgba(148,168,224,0.05) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(148,168,224,0.05) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size:64px 64px;
    mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 50% at 50% 0%, #000 40%, transparent 100%);
  }
  .glow-a{position:fixed; top:-200px; left:-150px; width:600px; height:600px; background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(61,107,255,0.25), transparent 70%); filter:blur(40px); z-index:0; pointer-events:none;}
  .glow-b{position:fixed; top:400px; right:-200px; width:500px; height:500px; background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(139,92,246,0.18), transparent 70%); filter:blur(40px); z-index:0; pointer-events:none;}

  /* nav */
  nav{
    position:sticky; top:0; z-index:50;
    backdrop-filter:blur(16px);
    background:rgba(6,10,22,0.72);
    border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .nav-inner{display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; height:68px;}
  .brand{font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif; font-weight:600; font-size:17px; letter-spacing:0.02em; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px;}
  .brand-mark{width:28px; height:28px; border-radius:8px; background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--electric),var(--violet)); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; font-size:13px; font-weight:700; color:#fff;}
  .nav-links{display:flex; gap:28px; font-size:13.5px; color:var(--text-dim);}
  .nav-links a{transition:color .2s;}
  .nav-links a:hover{color:var(--cyan);}
  #navToggle{display:none; background:none; border:none; color:var(--text); font-size:22px; cursor:pointer;}
  @media(max-width:860px){
    .nav-links{position:fixed; top:68px; left:0; right:0; background:var(--panel); flex-direction:column; padding:20px 32px; gap:16px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); transform:translateY(-130%); transition:transform .3s; }
    .nav-links.open{transform:translateY(0);}
    #navToggle{display:block;}
  }

  section{position:relative; z-index:1; padding:96px 0;}
  @media(max-width:640px){section{padding:64px 0;}}
  .eyebrow{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; font-size:12px; letter-spacing:0.14em; text-transform:uppercase;
    color:var(--cyan); display:flex; align-items:center; gap:10px; margin-bottom:18px;
  }
  .eyebrow::before{content:''; width:22px; height:1px; background:var(--cyan);}
  h2.section-title{font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,40px); font-weight:600; letter-spacing:-0.01em; margin-bottom:14px;}
  .section-sub{color:var(--text-dim); font-size:15.5px; max-width:640px; margin-bottom:48px;}

  /* HERO */
  .hero{padding-top:88px; padding-bottom:60px; min-height:92vh; display:flex; align-items:center;}
  .hero-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.1fr 0.9fr; gap:60px; align-items:center;}
  @media(max-width:900px){.hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;} .hero-visual{order:-1; margin-bottom:20px;}}
  .hero-tag{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; font-size:13px; color:var(--text-dimmer); letter-spacing:0.08em; margin-bottom:22px;}
  .hero h1{font-size:clamp(38px,6vw,64px); font-weight:700; line-height:1.04; letter-spacing:-0.02em; margin-bottom:22px;}
  .hero h1 .grad{background:linear-gradient(100deg,var(--electric),var(--cyan) 60%,var(--violet)); -webkit-background-clip:text; background-clip:text; color:transparent;}
  .hero p.lede{font-size:17px; color:var(--text-dim); max-width:520px; margin-bottom:34px;}
  .cycle-strip{display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:8px; margin-bottom:38px;}
  .cycle-strip span{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; font-size:12px; padding:6px 12px; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:100px; color:var(--text-dim);}
  .cycle-strip span.on{color:var(--cyan); border-color:rgba(34,211,238,0.4);}
  .cta-row{display:flex; gap:14px; flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .btn{
    padding:13px 24px; border-radius:10px; font-size:14px; font-weight:500; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:8px;
    transition:transform .18s, box-shadow .18s;
  }
  .btn-primary{background:linear-gradient(100deg,var(--electric),var(--violet)); color:#fff; box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(61,107,255,0.25);}
  .btn-primary:hover{transform:translateY(-2px); box-shadow:0 12px 30px rgba(61,107,255,0.35);}
  .btn-ghost{border:1px solid var(--line); color:var(--text);}
  .btn-ghost:hover{border-color:var(--cyan); color:var(--cyan);}

  /* hero visual: five-node orbit (Panch Mahabhuta signature) */
  .hero-visual{position:relative; height:420px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center;}
  .orbit-svg{width:100%; max-width:420px; height:auto;}
  .orbit-ring{fill:none; stroke:rgba(148,168,224,0.16); stroke-width:1;}
  .orbit-node-label{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; font-size:9.5px; fill:var(--text-dim); text-anchor:middle;}
  .orbit-core-label{font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif; font-size:12px; font-weight:600; fill:var(--text); text-anchor:middle;}
  @keyframes spin1{from{transform:rotate(0deg);} to{transform:rotate(360deg);}}
  @keyframes spin2{from{transform:rotate(360deg);} to{transform:rotate(0deg);}}
  .spin-cw{animation:spin1 46s linear infinite; transform-origin:210px 210px;}
  .spin-ccw{animation:spin2 60s linear infinite; transform-origin:210px 210px;}
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){ .spin-cw,.spin-ccw{animation:none;} }

  /* cards / glass */
  .glass{
    background:linear-gradient(160deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.035), rgba(255,255,255,0.008));
    border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:16px;
    backdrop-filter:blur(6px);
  }
  .card-hover{transition:border-color .2s, transform .2s;}
  .card-hover:hover{border-color:rgba(61,107,255,0.4); transform:translateY(-3px);}

  /* about / education */
  .about-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:56px;}
  @media(max-width:860px){.about-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:36px;}}
  .about-copy p{color:var(--text-dim); margin-bottom:16px; font-size:15px;}
  .timeline{border-left:1px solid var(--line); padding-left:24px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:26px;}
  .tl-item{position:relative;}
  .tl-item::before{content:''; position:absolute; left:-29px; top:4px; width:9px; height:9px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--cyan); box-shadow:0 0 0 4px rgba(34,211,238,0.15);}
  .tl-item h4{font-size:15px; font-weight:600; margin-bottom:4px;}
  .tl-item .tl-meta{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; font-size:11.5px; color:var(--text-dimmer); margin-bottom:6px;}
  .tl-item p{font-size:13.5px; color:var(--text-dim);}

  /* skills */
  .skill-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr); gap:16px;}
  @media(max-width:860px){.skill-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}}
  .skill-card{padding:24px 20px;}
  .skill-card h4{font-size:13px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.08em; color:var(--cyan); margin-bottom:14px; font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; font-weight:500;}
  .skill-tags{display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:6px;}
  .skill-tags span{font-size:12px; padding:4px 10px; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:100px; color:var(--text-dim);}

  /* knowledge hub tabs */
  .tabs{display:flex; gap:8px; flex-wrap:wrap; margin-bottom:28px;}
  .tab-btn{
    font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; font-size:12.5px; padding:9px 16px; border-radius:9px; border:1px solid var(--line); color:var(--text-dim); cursor:pointer; background:transparent; transition:all .2s;
  }
  .tab-btn.active{color:#fff; background:linear-gradient(100deg,var(--electric),var(--violet)); border-color:transparent;}
  .tab-panel{display:none;}
  .tab-panel.active{display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:14px;}
  @media(max-width:860px){.tab-panel.active{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}}
  @media(max-width:560px){.tab-panel.active{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
  .topic-chip{padding:16px 18px; font-size:13.5px; color:var(--text); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between;}
  .topic-chip small{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; color:var(--text-dimmer); font-size:11px;}

  /* projects */
  .project-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:20px;}
  @media(max-width:900px){.project-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}}
  @media(max-width:640px){.project-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
  .project-card{padding:26px; display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:12px; min-height:220px;}
  .project-card .ptag{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; font-size:10.5px; color:var(--violet); text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.08em;}
  .project-card h4{font-size:16.5px; font-weight:600;}
  .project-card p{font-size:13px; color:var(--text-dim); flex:1;}
  .project-card .plink{font-size:12.5px; color:var(--text-dimmer); font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px;}
  .pipeline{display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:6px; margin-top:6px;}
  .pipeline span{font-size:10.5px; font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; padding:3px 8px; background:rgba(61,107,255,0.08); border:1px solid rgba(61,107,255,0.2); border-radius:6px; color:#a9bdff;}

  /* idea vault */
  .idea-card{padding:30px; margin-bottom:18px;}
  .idea-head{display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:10px; margin-bottom:14px;}
  .idea-head h3{font-size:20px; font-weight:600;}
  .idea-status{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; font-size:10.5px; padding:5px 11px; border-radius:100px; letter-spacing:0.05em;}
  .status-concept{background:rgba(139,92,246,0.12); color:#c4b5fd; border:1px solid rgba(139,92,246,0.3);}
  .idea-body{display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr); gap:22px;}
  @media(max-width:700px){.idea-body{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
  .idea-field h5{font-size:11px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.08em; color:var(--text-dimmer); margin-bottom:6px; font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;}
  .idea-field p{font-size:13.5px; color:var(--text-dim);}

  /* explainers */
  .explainer-list{display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:10px;}
  .explainer-row{
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; padding:18px 22px; cursor:pointer;
  }
  .explainer-row .exq{font-size:14.5px; font-weight:500;}
  .explainer-row .exarrow{color:var(--text-dimmer); transition:transform .2s;}
  .explainer-row.open .exarrow{transform:rotate(90deg); color:var(--cyan);}
  .explainer-answer{display:none; padding:0 22px 20px; color:var(--text-dim); font-size:13.5px; line-height:1.7;}
  .explainer-answer .flow{display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:6px; margin-top:10px;}
  .explainer-answer .flow span{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; font-size:11px; padding:5px 10px; background:rgba(34,211,238,0.06); border:1px solid rgba(34,211,238,0.2); border-radius:7px; color:#8de8f2;}
  .explainer-answer .flow .arrow{background:none; border:none; color:var(--text-dimmer);}
  .explainer-row.open + .explainer-answer{display:block;}

  /* thinking */
  .think-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:16px;}
  @media(max-width:860px){.think-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}}
  @media(max-width:560px){.think-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
  .think-card{padding:22px;}
  .think-card h4{font-size:14.5px; margin-bottom:8px;}
  .think-card p{font-size:12.5px; color:var(--text-dim);}
  .leader-strip{display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:14px; margin-top:36px;}
  .leader-row{display:flex; align-items:center; gap:18px; padding:16px 20px;}
  .leader-name{font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif; font-weight:600; font-size:14px; width:140px; flex-shrink:0;}
  .leader-lessons{display:flex; gap:8px; flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .leader-lessons span{font-size:12px; color:var(--text-dim); font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;}
  .leader-lessons span:not(:last-child)::after{content:'·'; margin-left:8px; color:var(--text-dimmer);}

  /* contact/footer */
  footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line); padding:60px 0 40px;}
  .foot-grid{display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:24px;}
  .foot-links{display:flex; gap:22px; flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .foot-links a{color:var(--text-dim); font-size:13.5px; transition:color .2s;}
  .foot-links a:hover{color:var(--cyan);}
  .foot-note{font-size:12px; color:var(--text-dimmer); margin-top:30px; font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;}

  .roadmap-note{
    margin-top:56px; padding:22px 26px; border-radius:14px; border:1px dashed rgba(148,168,224,0.25); background:rgba(255,255,255,0.015);
  }
  .roadmap-note h4{font-size:13px; color:var(--cyan); font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.06em; margin-bottom:10px;}
  .roadmap-note p{font-size:13px; color:var(--text-dim);}

  .fill-me{color:#f0b354; font-style:italic;}

  /* story */
  .story-flow{display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:0; margin-top:10px;}
  .story-step{display:grid; grid-template-columns:110px 1fr; gap:24px; padding:26px 0; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);}
  .story-step:last-child{border-bottom:none;}
  @media(max-width:640px){.story-step{grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:8px;}}
  .story-step .s-phase{font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; font-size:11.5px; color:var(--cyan); letter-spacing:0.06em; text-transform:uppercase;}
  .story-step h4{font-size:16px; margin-bottom:8px;}
  .story-step p{font-size:14px; color:var(--text-dim);}

  /* articles */
  .article-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:20px;}
  @media(max-width:900px){.article-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}}
  @media(max-width:640px){.article-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
  .article-card{padding:0; overflow:hidden; display:flex; flex-direction:column;}
  .article-cover{
    height:110px; background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(61,107,255,0.18), rgba(139,92,246,0.18));
    display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; position:relative;
  }
  .article-cover .a-icon{font-family:'Space Grotesk',sans-serif; font-size:26px; font-weight:700; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.7);}
  .article-body{padding:22px;}
  .article-meta{display:flex; gap:10px; align-items:center; font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; font-size:10.5px; color:var(--text-dimmer); margin-bottom:10px; flex-wrap:wrap;}
  .article-meta .a-cat{color:var(--violet);}
  .article-body h4{font-size:15px; margin-bottom:8px; line-height:1.35;}
  .article-body p{font-size:12.5px; color:var(--text-dim); margin-bottom:14px;}
  .article-status{font-size:10.5px; font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace; padding:3px 9px; border-radius:100px; border:1px solid rgba(148,168,224,0.25); color:var(--text-dimmer); display:inline-block;}

  /* interests */
  .interest-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr); gap:14px;}
  @media(max-width:860px){.interest-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}}
  .interest-card{padding:22px 18px; text-align:center;}
  .interest-card .i-icon{font-size:22px; margin-bottom:10px;}
  .interest-card h4{font-size:13.5px; margin-bottom:6px;}
  .interest-card p{font-size:11.5px; color:var(--text-dim);}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="bg-grid"></div>
<div class="glow-a"></div>
<div class="glow-b"></div>

<nav>
  <div class="wrap nav-inner">
    <div class="brand"><span class="brand-mark">NK</span> NAVNEET KUMAR</div>
    <button id="navToggle" onclick="document.querySelector('.nav-links').classList.toggle('open')">☰</button>
    <div class="nav-links">
      <a href="#about">About</a>
      <a href="#story">My Story</a>
      <a href="#education">Education</a>
      <a href="#skills">Skills</a>
      <a href="#knowledge">Knowledge Hub</a>
      <a href="#projects">Projects</a>
      <a href="#articles">Articles</a>
      <a href="#ideas">Idea Vault</a>
      <a href="#explainers">Explainers</a>
      <a href="#thinking">Thinking</a>
      <a href="#interests">Interests</a>
      <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</nav>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap hero-grid">
    <div>
      <div class="hero-tag mono">// AI · DATA SCIENCE · TECHNOLOGY · INNOVATION</div>
      <h1>Building intelligent systems.<br><span class="grad">Explaining complex technology.</span></h1>
      <p class="lede">I'm Navneet Kumar — I work across AI, machine learning, and data science, and I write and design to make advanced technology understandable. Alongside applied projects, I develop long-horizon research concepts like <strong>VAIBHAVI 2047</strong>.</p>
      <div class="cycle-strip mono">
        <span class="on">BUILD</span><span>LEARN</span><span class="on">EXPLAIN</span><span>CREATE</span><span class="on">PUBLISH</span><span>IMPACT</span>
      </div>
      <div class="cta-row">
        <a href="#projects" class="btn btn-primary">View Projects →</a>
        <a href="#ideas" class="btn btn-ghost">Explore Idea Vault</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-visual">
      <svg class="orbit-svg" viewBox="0 0 420 420">
        <circle class="orbit-ring" cx="210" cy="210" r="170"/>
        <circle class="orbit-ring" cx="210" cy="210" r="120"/>
        <circle class="orbit-ring" cx="210" cy="210" r="70"/>
        <text class="orbit-core-label" x="210" y="205">NAVNEET</text>
        <text class="orbit-core-label" x="210" y="222" style="font-size:9px; fill:#8b96b8;">AI · DATA · TECH</text>

        <g class="spin-cw">
          <circle cx="210" cy="40" r="15" fill="url(#g1)"/>
          <text class="orbit-node-label" x="210" y="20">AKASH · AI</text>
        </g>
        <g class="spin-cw" style="transform-origin:210px 210px; transform:rotate(72deg);">
          <circle cx="210" cy="40" r="15" fill="url(#g2)"/>
        </g>
        <g class="spin-ccw">
          <circle cx="380" cy="210" r="12" fill="url(#g3)"/>
          <text class="orbit-node-label" x="380" y="234">JAL · DATA</text>
        </g>
        <g class="spin-ccw" style="transform-origin:210px 210px; transform:rotate(144deg);">
          <circle cx="380" cy="210" r="12" fill="url(#g1)"/>
        </g>
        <g class="spin-cw" style="transform-origin:210px 210px; transform:rotate(216deg);">
          <circle cx="210" cy="40" r="10" fill="url(#g2)"/>
        </g>

        <defs>
          <linearGradient id="g1" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1">
            <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#3d6bff"/><stop offset="100%" stop-color="#22d3ee"/>
          </linearGradient>
          <linearGradient id="g2" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1">
            <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#8b5cf6"/><stop offset="100%" stop-color="#3d6bff"/>
          </linearGradient>
          <linearGradient id="g3" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1">
            <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#22d3ee"/><stop offset="100%" stop-color="#8b5cf6"/>
          </linearGradient>
        </defs>
      </svg>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ABOUT -->
<section id="about">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow">01 · About</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Working across AI, data, and long-term technology vision</h2>
    <div class="about-grid" style="margin-top:20px;">
      <div class="about-copy">
        <p>My work sits at the intersection of applied machine learning and data science — building models, cleaning and exploring data, and shipping small working tools — and a longer-range interest in how technologies like AI, robotics, and environmental science could be organized around Indian philosophical frameworks over the next two decades.</p>
        <p>I care about the "explain" step as much as the "build" step: a model or a concept is only useful if someone else can understand why it works. That's why articles, explainers, and structured write-ups sit alongside the project work here, not as an afterthought.</p>
